                                "sense_id": "2ceec8ad-f09b-36f1-b0a8-2df79acd6791",
                                "text": "However, if you really want to try to communicate sophisticated things from your field to a general audience, really the best thing may be for you to simply do it yourself — to augment your skillset with the ability to take esoterica and translate it into an article or a video that lots of normal people will want to watch."
                            }
